<title>USA: North Dakota housing bonds account closed.</title>
<headline>North Dakota housing bonds account closed.</headline>
<text>
<p>STATE OF NORTH DAKOTA</p>
<p>RE: $17,000,000</p>
<p>NORTH DAKOTA HOUSING FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>HOUSING FINANCE PROGRAM BONDS</p>
<p>HOME MORTGAGE FINANCE PROGRAM</p>
<p>1996 SERIES B</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>IF THERE ARE NO OBJECTIONS THE ISSUE WILL BE FREE TO TRADE AT</p>
<p>3:00PM TODAY.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Dain Bosworth Incorporated</p>
<p>Piper, Jaffray, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
